   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPPF: CORE CONTRIBUTION 2021 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPPF&#xb4;s focus areas in the current as well as the future strategic framework correspond with Denmark&#xb4;s commitment to promoting a human rights-based approach to development and SRHR.

The key complementary areas of Danish development policy and IPPF&#xb4;s objectives are:
1. SRHR ad human rights
2. To reach vulnerable population groups through a human rights-based approach
3. young people&#xb4;s access to information and services
4. Encouraging an integrated approach to SRGR and HIV/AIDS

F2: 2021-43111</narrative>
